00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,026
The result is a plain valuation report: a grade from A to E, a business score, and a low, mid and high value.

2
00:00:07,026 --> 00:00:11,335
Each part explains its score, and every figure links to the page it came from.

3
00:00:11,335 --> 00:00:14,371
A finding that cites a page we never read is dropped.

4
00:00:14,371 --> 00:00:16,359
No source, no number.

